{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5001_p", "source_sha256": "a1a3825c302bddfcdc7c1b35f8f7588483a5f95c9d22c471063f7a883c05644d", "ja": "（今日は公園で、冷凍食品のCM撮影だ。\nさっそくやよいにお弁当を試食してもらっている）", "zh": "（今天要在公园拍摄冷冻食品广告。已经让弥生试吃便当了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5002_005yay", "source_sha256": "eaffe467d6c14f4b44c760cf8dfa405dccc466bb64c9b03070d4a63e293ac31f", "ja": "このハンバーグ、すっごくおいしいです～！\nちっちゃくて食べやすくて、お弁当にピッタリですね！", "zh": "这个汉堡肉饼特别好吃～！\n小小的，很方便入口，放在便当里正合适呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5003_p", "source_sha256": "427de98207575b6f90910d786fb76162eb44855ea48a52147b81d75928da8a08", "ja": "ああ、美味しそうな焦げ目もついてるし、\n最近の冷凍食品はすごいな。", "zh": "啊，看起来还煎出了漂亮的焦痕，\n最近的冷冻食品真厉害啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5004_005yay", "source_sha256": "6748b3360ac6e15470cf05cd30cad394ef6a15c5e9e392e7ed9728d3d7be5e43", "ja": "はい！　私、もっともーっといろんな人に、\nこのハンバーグを食べてもらいたいなーって！", "zh": "是！我想让更多更多的人，都能尝到这个汉堡肉排！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5005_005yay", "source_sha256": "cba102ee9ef80d619af16c380d32a708ff498bfb223c361889de0d5d05048d96", "ja": "でも、すっごくおいしいよーっていうの、\nどうすればお客さんに伝わるんでしょうか……？", "zh": "可是，要怎么做才能让客人感受到它“真的超级好吃”呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5006_p", "source_sha256": "0372a5101e9d8a6857c5bab1eccb91f707f6a0e0fefa41883154ed8218b1ab27", "ja": "そうだなあ、美味しさを伝えるには……。", "zh": "这个嘛，要把美味传达出去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5007", "source_sha256": "6d05fb295958e77a97b17dcfcafef6a8db24cf26f199149b7ef2d5e5b9b2720c", "ja": "食べっぷり", "zh": "吃相", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5008", "source_sha256": "0197244a5cc6eab1e8d55b48e620d8ecd3a3400d3de0943dc098f08373de4b63", "ja": "キャッチフレーズ", "zh": "宣传语", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5200_p", "source_sha256": "13ddc6363562a5c36c8e30fa65478d7e42551b3eada8ae62918714f5872d3a6d", "ja": "やよいの食べている姿で、美味しさを\n表現できるといいかもな。", "zh": "要是能用弥生吃东西的样子，\n来展现有多美味就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5201_005yay", "source_sha256": "03466c88c560cb00dfaa459e0e3ee2bf0d8994849e71945638d9d52eea7b4434", "ja": "あ、そうですね！　このハンバーグを食べると、\n自然と笑顔になれるんです！", "zh": "啊，对呢！吃下这个汉堡肉，就会自然而然地露出笑容！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5202_005yay", "source_sha256": "71b7359d787afb77a73bd9c55b9b2bbe131c3299b4cb46cd5bf2c04cfd5d282d", "ja": "その笑顔でおいしいよーってアピールしたら、\nしっかり伝わるかも！　うっうー、やってみまーす！", "zh": "如果用那个笑容宣传“很好吃哦——”，说不定就能好好传达出去！呜呜——我试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5300_p", "source_sha256": "13ddc6363562a5c36c8e30fa65478d7e42551b3eada8ae62918714f5872d3a6d", "ja": "やよいの食べている姿で、美味しさを\n表現できるといいかもな。", "zh": "要是能用弥生吃东西的样子，\n来展现有多美味就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5301_005yay", "source_sha256": "e9fadb9d87398fc1fecbf699958c9950b396a21de3d3a06aaf698f714dfc8766", "ja": "そっか、そうですよね！　私、さっき食べた時、\nおいしすぎて、夢中でパクパク食べちゃったんです。", "zh": "这样啊，确实呢！我刚才吃的时候，因为太好吃了，就一不小心埋头大口吃了起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5302_005yay", "source_sha256": "4d3392767f40e0a42040833bd336a158e0fff63a1fddc0a6d97408f8525f291f", "ja": "だから、おはしが止まらなくなっちゃう感じで\nどんどん食べてみまーす！　……伝わるかな～。", "zh": "所以，就有种筷子停不下来的感觉，\n我会大口大口地继续吃下去的！……这样能传达出来吗～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5500_p", "source_sha256": "1f356c1fb129b2b2206f650bd8852e026c6b676b26a8d897aeb80cf4b8924c7f", "ja": "キャッチフレーズなんてどうだろう？\n美味しさがイメージしやすい一言があるといいな。", "zh": "宣传标语怎么样？\n要是能有一句让人容易联想到美味的话就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5501_005yay", "source_sha256": "539fd5736530e87eb8ee1f69d504d09cdda7b75e35417723c7e064a8ab56d56f", "ja": "そうですね！　うーん……あっ！　公園で食べてたら、\nなんだか遠足みたいだなーって思いました！", "zh": "是呀！嗯……啊！在公园里吃的话，\n感觉就像是在郊游一样——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5502_005yay", "source_sha256": "767be426a4bafeff39f07d6b5c59ac77a1f47eef6cc9a51af4a43b5c012b7677", "ja": "だから、「楽しい遠足が、もっともっと楽しくなる\nハンバーグ！」っていうのはどうですか？　えへへ♪", "zh": "所以，“让快乐的郊游变得更加更加快乐的汉堡！”怎么样？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5600_p", "source_sha256": "1f356c1fb129b2b2206f650bd8852e026c6b676b26a8d897aeb80cf4b8924c7f", "ja": "キャッチフレーズなんてどうだろう？\n美味しさがイメージしやすい一言があるといいな。", "zh": "宣传标语怎么样？\n要是能有一句让人容易联想到美味的话就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5601_005yay", "source_sha256": "2e9bbbc03b0160d74368b8a1bb5e4e3b69a9220e260f6ea5de1b651233d0c98f", "ja": "わかりました！　それじゃあ、えーと……お弁当って\n友達とわけっこするのも楽しいから……。", "zh": "明白了！那么，呃……便当和朋友一起分享也很开心，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_5602_005yay", "source_sha256": "69dd10abd56806e4256ed9cd8ae2ef4d88acb67801ca9c48780c86350556a024", "ja": "「おいしすぎて、みんなにもおすそわけしたくなって、\n自分の分がなくなっちゃう！」……あれ、いいのかな？", "zh": "“太好吃了，忍不住想分给大家，\n结果自己的那份都没了！”……咦，这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
